# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Secrets. The service env file lives in ~/.config and must never land here,
# but ignore the usual names anyway -- this repo fronts an agent with shell
# access, so a leaked token is not a papercut.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
hermes-mobile-pwa.env

# Runtime state. Push subscription endpoints are capability URLs.
subscriptions.json
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Local working notes: contain local paths, profile names and live session
# detail. Design decisions worth keeping are written up in docs/ instead.
PLAN.md
AUDIT.md
NOTES.md
scratch/

# Editors and OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
